        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Giuseppe Garibaldi</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1807 CE – 1882 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Born</span><span class="info-stat-val">4 July 1807 in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nice">Nice</a>, christened Joseph-Marie Garibaldi; son of Domenico Garibaldi of Chiavari and Maria Rosa Nicoletta Raimondi of Loano, a Ligurian family in the coastal trade</span></div>
